WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.465
Today we will strengthen performance through reflection. Our work connects with

00:00:04.465 --> 00:00:06.792
selected artists and traditions in Ghana.

00:00:07.617 --> 00:00:13.134
Identify one timing or storytelling issue from feedback. Name a design choice that a

00:00:13.134 --> 00:00:15.105
selected Ghanaian artist might make.

00:00:15.950 --> 00:00:18.147
Rehearse a concrete change as a group.

00:00:19.950 --> 00:00:23.555
Restage the piece and explain the difference between the two versions.
